-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, ich habe deinen Zeitplan gesehen — du hast morgen früh doch noch einen Termin, oder?","speaker":"Yara","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Stimmt, deshalb wollte ich fragen: Könnten wir die Wiederholung eine Stunde vorziehen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Kein Problem.","speaker":"Yara","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Übrigens hat mir eine Kollegin erzählt, der letzte Termin sei ihr viel zu früh gewesen.","speaker":"Yara","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Dann sind wir ja nicht die Einzigen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Gut, dass wir das vorher klären.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, ich habe deinen Zeitplan gesehen — du hast morgen früh doch noch einen Termin, oder?","speaker":"Yara","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_063_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-63-goethe-mini-5